     why: Keep Pumper 1 cooling A6 and Pumper 2 cooling A4 while A5 burns. Keep Glenvale homes and Glenvale Primary sheltered, as another stream showed no benefit.
     sensor: B4's battery sensor is flat beside the fire, so tests used the camera estimate of 34 C.
